# libc6 ships libc.so.6 itself: its other libraries (libm.so.6, libpthread.so.0, libresolv.so.2, ...)
# record DT_NEEDED libc.so.6 and find it in this same package, so no Depends can declare it. Only
# that exact prerequisite is covered: a library needing anything more still raises the tag.
libc6: undeclared-elf-prerequisites (libc.so.6) [usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/*]
# libmvec.so.1's lanes call libm.so.6's scalar functions (DT_NEEDED libm.so.6 and libc.so.6), and
# libc6 ships both: covered for that one library and that exact pair (SYS-DBG-DWARF).
libc6: undeclared-elf-prerequisites (libc.so.6 libm.so.6) [usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libmvec.so.1]
